'''Rhyperior''' (Japanese: '''ドサイドン''' ''Dosidon'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

