==Trivia==
*This card's illustration rare print features {{p|Rhyperior}} and {{p|Geodude}} as well as two [[Worker]]s inside the [[Oreburgh Mine]].
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Rhyperior|62}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*'''Mountain Swing''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Tyranitar|88}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

